title: "GOAA Lite - Governance-Oriented Agent Architecture (Introductory Edition)"
abstract: "GOAA (Governance-Oriented Agent Architecture) is a governance layer for human-AI collaboration: make AI controllable and keep your memory yours. Lite is the minimal introductory edition - a 5-minute bootstrap verifying that your AI memory belongs entirely to you."
